# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads to Cloud Build: only what Dockerfile.api needs.
# Without this file gcloud would follow .gitignore, which leaves out deploy/model/ (the model package).
# Never upload data/ or runs/: scans and labels stay on this machine.
# Check before building:  gcloud meta list-files-for-upload
*
!Dockerfile.api
!requirements-api.txt
!src/
!src/hippo/
!src/hippo/**
!deploy/
!deploy/model/
!deploy/model/**
**/__pycache__/
